    <div class="website-demo__bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>YOUR BUSINESS, LOOKING ITS BEST</span></div>
    <div class="website-demo__body">
      <div class="website-demo__nav"><strong>evergreen<span style="color:#668344">.</span><br /><small style="font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.08em">LAWN & LANDSCAPE</small></strong><span>Services &nbsp; About &nbsp; Get in touch ↗</span></div>
      <div class="website-demo__hero"><span>GOOD NEIGHBORS. GREAT YARDS.</span><h3>A yard you love.<br />A team you trust.</h3><p>Lawn care and landscaping, with the same care we give our own backyards.</p><span class="demo-button">Request a free estimate <span>↗</span></span></div>
      <div class="website-demo__services"><div><Icon name="leaf" />Lawn care</div><div><Icon name="tree" />Landscaping</div><div><Icon name="calendar" />Seasonal cleanups</div></div>
    </div>
  </div><p class="demo-caption">Illustrative design concept · Not a client project</p>
